s: लिङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शकि लिङ् च ३.३.१७२", "३.३.१७२", "३.३.१७२ शकि लिङ् च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["Saki liN ca ३.३.१७२", "३.३.१७२", "३.३.१७२ Saki liN ca"]}], "saki RamulkamulO": [{"id": "Saki RamulkamulO", "headword": "शकि णमुल्कमुलौ", "headword_slp1": "Saki RamulkamulO", "fold": "saki RamulkamulO", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes णमुल् and कमुल् are added to roots in the छन्दस् (Vedas) to form Infinitives, when they are governed by the verb शक् 'to be able'.\n\nTerms: णमुल् and कमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शकि णमुल्कमुलौ ३.४.१२", "३.४.१२", "३.४.१२ शकि णमुल्कमुलौ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["Saki RamulkamulO ३.४.१२", "३.४.१२", "३.४.१२ Saki RamulkamulO"]}], "sakaDfsajYaglaGawaraBalaBakramasaharhastyarTesu tumun": [{"id": "SakaDfzajYAglAGawaraBalaBakramasahArhAstyarTezu tumun", "headword": "शकधृषज्ञाग्लाघटरभलभक्रमसहार्हास्त्यर्थेषु तुमुन्", "headword_slp1": "SakaDfzajYAglAGawaraBalaBakramasahArhAstyarTezu tumun", "fold": "sakaDfsajYaglaGawaraBalaBakramasaharhastyarTesu tumun", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix तुमुन् is added to every verb when another verb having the sense of 1. शक् 'to be able' 2. धृष् 'to make bold' 3. ज्ञा 'to know' 4. ग्लै 'to be weary' 5. घट् 'to strive' 6. रभ् 'to begin' 7. लभ् 'to get' 8. क्रम् 'to set about' 9. सह् 'to bear' 10. अर्ह् 'to be pleased or to condescend' 11. अस् 'to be'.\n\nTerms: तुमुन्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शकधृषज्ञाग्लाघटरभलभक्रमसहार्हास्त्यर्थेषु तुमुन् ३.४.६५", "३.४.६५", "३.४.६५ शकधृषज्ञाग्लाघटरभलभक्रमसहार्हास्त्यर्थेषु तुमुन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SakaDfzajYAglAGawaraBalaBakramasahArhAstyarTezu tumun ३.४.६५", "३.४.६५", "३.४.६५ SakaDfzajYAglAGawaraBalaBakramasahArhAstyarTezu tumun"]}], "sakaladva": [{"id": "SAkalAdvA", "headword": "शाकलाद्वा", "headword_slp1": "SAkalAdvA", "fold": "sakaladva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix अण् optionally comes in the sense of 'this is his congregation, mark, sign or hamlet' after the word शाकल।\n\nTerms: अण्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शाकलाद्वा ४.३.१२८", "४.३.१२८", "४.३.१२८ शाकलाद्वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SAkalAdvA ४.३.१२८", "४.३.१२८", "४.३.१२८ SAkalAdvA"]}], "saktiyaswyorikak": [{"id": "SaktiyazwyorIkak", "headword": "शक्तियष्ट्योरीकक्", "headword_slp1": "SaktiyazwyorIkak", "fold": "saktiyaswyorikak", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix ईकक् comes in the sense of 'this is whose weapon' after the words 1. शक्ति and 2. यष्ट्यि।\n\nTerms: ईकक्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शक्तियष्ट्योरीकक् ४.४.५९", "४.४.५९", "४.४.५९ शक्तियष्ट्योरीकक्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SaktiyazwyorIkak ४.४.५९", "४.४.५९", "४.४.५९ SaktiyazwyorIkak"]}], "sakawadaR": [{"id": "SakawAdaR", "headword": "शकटादण्", "headword_slp1": "SakawAdaR", "fold": "sakawadaR", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix अण् comes in the sense of 'what bears it' after the word शकट being in Accusative -2nd case construction.\n\nTerms: अण्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["शकटादण् ४.४.८०", "४.४.८०", "४.४.८० शकटादण्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SakawAdaR ४.४.८०", "४.४.८०", "४.४.८० SakawAdaR"]}], "saksadraswari sanjYayam": [{"id": "sAkzAddrazwari saMjYAyAm", "headword": "साक्षाद्द्रष्टरि संज्ञायाम्", "headword_slp1": "sAkzAddrazwari saMjYAyAm", "fold": "saksadraswari sanjYayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix इनि comes in the sense of 'a spectator, looker on' after the word साक्षात् when the word so formed is a Name.\n\nTerms: इनि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["साक्षाद्द्रष्टरि संज्ञायाम् ५.२.९१", "५.२.९१", "५.२.९१ साक्षाद्द्रष्टरि संज्ञायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["sAkzAddrazwari saMjYAyAm ५.२.९१", "५.२.९१", "५.२.९१ sAkzAddrazwari saMjYAyAm"]}], "sakTan cakrantat‌": [{"id": "